		measure 'Sales Range Measure' = ```

				VAR NetSalesValue = [Net Sale]  // Your Net Sales measure
				RETURN
				SWITCH(
				    TRUE(),
				    NetSalesValue >= 0 && NetSalesValue <= 3000, "0-3k",
				    NetSalesValue >= 3001 && NetSalesValue <= 5000, "03k-05k",
				    NetSalesValue >= 5001 && NetSalesValue <= 6000, "05k-06k",
				    NetSalesValue >= 6001 && NetSalesValue <= 7000, "06k-07k",
				    NetSalesValue >= 7001 && NetSalesValue <= 8000, "07k-08k",
				    NetSalesValue >= 8001 && NetSalesValue <= 9000, "08k-09k",
				    NetSalesValue >= 9001 && NetSalesValue <= 10000, "09k-10k",
				    NetSalesValue >= 10001 && NetSalesValue <= 20000, "10k-20k",
				    NetSalesValue >= 20001 && NetSalesValue <= 35000, "20k-35k",
				    NetSalesValue >= 35001 && NetSalesValue <= 50000, "35k-50k",
				    NetSalesValue >= 50001 && NetSalesValue <= 100000, "50k-1Lakh",
				    NetSalesValue >= 100001 && NetSalesValue <= 150000, "1Lakh-1.5Lakh",
				    NetSalesValue > 150001, "1.5Lakh+",
				    BLANK()
				)
				```
			lineageTag: 8723c394-eb2d-4d2b-b284-1007c9d85b70

