		measure 'MOM% AddToCart' = ```

				VAR _MinDate = MIN('DateTable'[Date])
				VAR _MaxDate = MAX('DateTable'[Date])

				VAR _CM = [Add To Cart]

				VAR _PM =
				    CALCULATE(
				        SUM('Facebook Ads Share BI'[Adds_to_Cart__Facebook_Ads]),
				        DATESBETWEEN(
				            'DateTable'[Date],
				            EDATE(_MinDate, -1),
				            EDATE(_MaxDate, -1)
				        )
				    )
				RETURN
				DIVIDE(_CM - _PM, _PM)
				```
			lineageTag: 3a0589f5-db47-4c90-8bfa-875eed5dd495

			formatStringDefinition = "+0.00%;-0.00%;0.00%"

